flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated MERCHANT opens /merchant/register] --> B[Submit business details]
    B --> C[Gateway injects verified user ID and role]
    C --> D[POST /api/v1/merchants/register]
    D --> E[PENDING_APPROVAL persisted with ownerUserId]
    E --> F[Keys and order ingestion blocked]
    E --> G[SYSTEM_ADMIN reviews /ops/merchants]
    G --> H{Approve or reject?}
    H -->|Approve: pending + owner required| I[APPROVED: approvedBy and approvedAt saved]
    H -->|Reject: nonblank reason required| J[REJECTED: rejection reason saved]
    J --> K[Keys and order ingestion remain blocked]
    I --> L[After commit: publish merchant.approved]
    L --> M[IAM consumer links merchantId to owner]
    M --> N[Merchant signs in again to refresh claims]
    N --> O[Generate API key; raw secret returned once]
    O --> P[Create merchant orders; show dashboard tracking]
    Q[Non-admin caller] -->|403| R[Admin review denied]
    S[Integration dependency: admin merchant gateway routes must be added] -.-> G
    T[SUSPENDED enum exists; no suspend endpoint in this workflow] -.-> K
